---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="사업분야"
  description="부동산 시장 분석을 바탕으로 컨설팅, 리서치, 분양대행, 협력사업을 제공하는 ㈜혁본의 사업분야입니다."
>
  <article
    class="w-full px-4 md:px-0 pt-20 pb-40 max-w-[384px] md:w-[712px] lg:w-[948px] xl:w-[1316px] md:max-w-none mx-auto text-26 md:text-30"
  >
    <h1 class="text-28 md:text-40">사업분야</h1>
    <div class="pt-4 text-16 break-normal">
      <p>살아 숨쉬는 부동산 시장을 분석하고</p>
      <p>최적의 컨설팅과 솔루션을 제안합니다.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="pt-20 md:pt-32">
      <ul
        class="flex divide-y md:divide-y-0 justify-between md:divide-x-2 divide-gray-200 flex-row text-28 md:text-22 lg:text-28 flex-wrap"
      >
        <li class="w-full md:w-auto pb-4 md:pb-0">
          <a href="/scope/research">
            <h3>RESEARCH</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">리서치 및 시장조사</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="w-full md:w-auto py-4 md:pt-0 md:pl-5 md:-mr-6">
          <a href="/scope/consulting">
            <h3>CONSULTING</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">마케팅 컨설팅 및 기획</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="w-full md:w-auto md:pl-5 py-4 md:pt-0 md:-mr-6">
          <a href="/scope/selling">
            <h3>SELLING</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">부동산 분양대행</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="w-1/2 md:w-auto md:pl-5 pt-4 md:pt-0">
          <a href="/scope/allience">
            <h3>ALLIENCE</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">전략적 제휴</p>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <div
      class="w-full rounded-lg mt-40 hidden md:flex  h-[400px] relative overflow-hidden"
    >
      <img
        src="/사업분야.jpg"
        alt=""
        width="2000"
        height="1000"
        class="absolute w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
      />
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
